{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33943","headline":"奉和鲁望上元日道室焚修 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望上元日道室焚修","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明真台上下仙官，玄藻初吟万籁寒。\n飙御有声时杳杳，宝衣无影自珊珊。\n蘂书乞见斋心易，玉籍求添拜首难。\n端简不知清景暮，灵芜香烬落金坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}